      "content": "It's a good start, but honestly, the score is still pretty low. The documentation team is gonna flag this for being too short. \n\nCan you expand on this? Go into much more detail for each step—maybe explain *why* certain steps work or give more background on what a VPN timeout actually is. Just make sure you really pump up the word count. The goal is to get a much higher score on that word count metric.",
